PI-bot is a local adaptation of FeiZhuLulu/DeepSeek-Bot (Apache-2.0).
Upstream: https://github.com/FeiZhuLulu/DeepSeek-Bot
Prior renderer source provenance is preserved under renderer/upstream/provenance.json.
The 2026-10-13 audit compared the user's ds-bot 0.1.3 download and upstream commit 7e1c5184d63e796def85469793117befbbe5003f.
This version ports mention parsing and four theme palettes and adapts memory, capabilities, scheduling and runtime communication to PI-Desktop.
Administrator completions have no tools. Groups select serial or parallel workers; each member's native session is serialized.
Custom PI-bot artwork and launcher/return extension files are retained from the existing local plugin.
The adapter targets the documented PI-Desktop 0.18 plugin API. Host application files and user data are not bundled or patched.
DSH-specific features and differences are described in README.zh.md and the migration report.

